---
import HeroText from '~/components/widgets/HeroText.astro';
import Button from '~/components/ui/Button.astro';
import Image from '~/components/common/Image.astro';
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import aboutImage from '~/assets/images/about-me.jpg';

const metadata = {
  title: 'About',
  description: 'I am Siva Rajadurai and this is my blog of ideas.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <!-- HeroText Widget ******************* -->

  <HeroText tagline="About" title="About Me" />

  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <Image
      src={aboutImage}
      alt="Siva Rajadurai"
      layout="fixed"
      width={160}
      height={160}
      class="mx-auto mb-8 rounded-full object-cover shadow-lg ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-slate-800"
    />

    <div
      class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert dark:prose-headings:text-slate-300 prose-a:text-primary dark:prose-a:text-blue-400 mx-auto"
    >
      <p>
        I'm Siva Rajadurai. I lead cloud, data, and AI platform engineering at Humana, where my org builds the platforms
        the rest of the enterprise runs on — the Azure & GCP foundation, Relational, NoSQL & Cache Databases, Databricks
        and Snowflake, orchestration, and the governance layer that keeps it all trustworthy under healthcare
        regulation.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've been building platforms since 2009. What still holds my attention is the part most people find tedious: the
        operating model. Anyone can stand up a platform. Getting hundreds of engineers to use it well, safely, and
        without a central team becoming the bottleneck — that's the actual problem, and it's mostly an organizational
        one wearing a technical costume.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I work through that in public. Architecture decisions, what they cost, and what I'd do
        differently.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work I'm with my family, reading — usually somewhere near the intersection of technology and philosophy
        — or hiking somewhere new. Always happy to talk platforms. Reach me at <a href="mailto:sivanandha@gmail.com"
          >sivanandha@gmail.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center py-12 md:py-16">
      <Button variant="primary" href="/contact">Get in touch</Button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
